{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267Mfs5Uetql1794865113.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>尖沙咀有私家車後退逃避路障截查，撞毀四輛的士後逃去無蹤，一名的士司機受傷，清醒送院。</p><p></p><p>網上片段可見，涉事白色私家車為逃避警方截查，突然後退，再駛向另一方向逃去。</p><p></p><p>凌晨一時許，警方在彌敦道向尖沙咀方向、近聖安德烈堂對開設置路障，涉事私家車駛至，隨後突然後退，期間撞毀四輛的士，逆線駛入山林道後不知所終，當中一名的士司機腰部受傷，送院治理。警方追緝涉事私家車司機歸案。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T22:44:41.754739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T22:58:01.577303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:37:48.629777+00:00","content_hash":"1eda499352af7a0a9c5b3560f03c30b4ad87bd117ae1410bf1e8db0c33094a99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T22:44:41.754739+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}